<section class="featured-story">
            <picture>
                            <source data-srcset="https://www.owens.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/nursing-feature-story.webp" media="(min-width: 64em)">
                <img decoding="async" data-src="https://www.owens.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/mobile_feature_rntobsn.webp" alt="nursing students" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" class="lazyload" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 780px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 780/780;">
                    </picture>
        <div class="text-container" style="--container-height:500px;">
        <h2>From RN to BSN</h2>
        <p>Designed for working RNs, our Bachelor of Science in Nursing program combines online convenience with hands-on clinical experience. Develop advanced leadership skills, deepen your clinical expertise, and open doors to supervisory roles.</p>
                    <a href="https://www.owens.edu/news-releases/2025/08/14/owens-announces-first-bachelors-degree-in-historic-milestone-for-regions-leading-healthcare-educator/" target="_self">Learn more</a>
                    <a href="https://www.owens.edu/academics/programs/bachelor-of-science-degree-in-nursing-bsn/" target="_self">Apply to a B.S. in Nursing Program</a>
            </div>
    </section>


<section class="testimonial-slider content-width">
      <div class="intro-text">
      <h2>In Their Own Words</h2>
<p>Real students. True success. Read how these Owens graduates turned their educational goals into life-changing careers.</p>
    </div>
    <img decoding="async" data-src="https://www.owens.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Maijoy-Wooten600x560.webp" alt="Maijoy Wooten" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" class="lazyload" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 600px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 600/560;">
  <div class="slider">
    <p class="slide-count sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" role="status">Showing slide 1 of 3.</p>
  	<div class="slides">
                  <div class="slide" style="--image:https://www.owens.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Maijoy-Wooten600x560.webp" >
            <div class="slide-text">
              <p class="name">Maijoy Wooten</p>
              <p class="program">Surgical Technology Program, ‘26</p>
              <p>&quot;Owens is an elite training ground for the future of healthcare. My education at Owens prepared me far beyond what I could have ever imagined. The program provided extensive hands-on experience across three surgical rotations, allowing me to build confidence and proficiency before starting my first job.”</p>
                              <a href="https://www.owens.edu/news-releases/2026/08/06/owens-grad-wins-national-surgical-tech-honors-in-first-year-on-the-job/" target="_self">Read Maijoy&#039;s Story</a>
                          </div>
          </div>
                  <div class="slide" style="--image:https://www.owens.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/testimonial-jona-devalt.webp"  aria-hidden="true" >
            <div class="slide-text">
              <p class="name">Jon’a Devalt</p>
              <p class="program">American Sign Language Certificate, ‘22</p>
              <p>“I’ve gone back to Waite High School and talked to students in the American Sign Language club and told them about what Owens has to offer and the students are very excited about being able to pursue their passion and goals of being interpreters right in their own backyard.”</p>
                              <a href="https://www.owens.edu/about/offices-departments/marketing-communications/stories/success-stories/jona-devalt/" target="_self">Read Jon&#039;a&#039;s Story</a>
                          </div>
          </div>
                  <div class="slide" style="--image:https://www.owens.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Britney-Jeziorowski-600x560-1.webp"  aria-hidden="true" >
            <div class="slide-text">
              <p class="name">Britney Jeziorowski</p>
              <p class="program">Health Information Technology, ’24</p>
              <p>“The inclusive culture was a mixture of people of different ages and different backgrounds. It’s surreal and wouldn’t be possible without the accessibility Owens offers and the enthusiasm and compassion exhibited by my instructors.”</p>
                              <a href="https://www.owens.edu/about/offices-departments/marketing-communications/stories/success-stories/britney-jeziorowski/" target="_self">Read Britney&#039;s Story</a>
                          </div>
          </div>
            </div>
	<button class="slider-left slider-prev" aria-label="Previous Testimonial"></button>
	<button class="slider-right slider-next" aria-label="Next Testimonial"></button>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="factoid-showcase black">
	<div class="content-width">
        <h2>Proven Success</h2>
        <div class="text-container">
                            <div class="factoid">
                	<a class="factoid-link" aria-label="100%" href="https://www.owens.edu/academics/programs/dental-hygiene-program-aas/" target=""></a>                    <p class="number">100%</p>
                    <p class="subtext">Job placement rate for Owens alumni after graduation from the Dental Hygiene Program, AAS program.</p>
                </div>
                            <div class="factoid">
                	<a class="factoid-link" aria-label="$60K+" href="https://www.owens.edu/academics/programs/computer-networking-systems-administration-program-aas/" target=""></a>                    <p class="number">$60K+</p>
                    <p class="subtext">Potential salary for entry-level roles In Ohio from Computer Networking &amp; Systems Administration Program, AAS</p>
                </div>
                            <div class="factoid">
                	                    <p class="number">14:1</p>
                    <p class="subtext">Student-to-faculty ratio, offering a personalized learning environment in many programs.</p>
                </div>
                    </div>
    </div>
</section>

